   "file": "Q00086_SagaOfTheHierophant/7-03.htm",
   "quest": 86,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: I must get the Stone of Commune away from Naverius!",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00086_SagaOfTheHierophant/7-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00086_SagaOfTheHierophant/7-04.htm",
   "quest": 86,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: There's a disturbance far from here. This isn't the time to get involved.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00086_SagaOfTheHierophant/7-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00086_SagaOfTheHierophant/7-06.htm",
   "quest": 86,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Suddenly, huge amounts of knowledge are painfully seared into your brain. Some secrets of the tablet start to be revealed. Suddenly, the vision goes white... and emerging from within is a face... Could it be...? Bastian in the Goddard Castle Town? And then, just as suddenly, the v…",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00090_SagaOfTheStormScreamer/7-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00090_SagaOfTheStormScreamer/7-02.htm",
   "quest": 90,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Fallen Angel Allector? I should have known! What was I thinking? I sense that he has the Stone of Commune.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00090_SagaOfTheStormScreamer/7-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00090_SagaOfTheStormScreamer/7-03.htm",
   "quest": 90,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The time has come to get the first Stone of Commune. Destroy Allector and take his stone.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00090_SagaOfTheStormScreamer/7-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00090_SagaOfTheStormScreamer/7-04.htm",
   "quest": 90,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Someone nearby must have the Stone of Commune! It's too noisy now. Try again later when things quiet down a bit.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00090_SagaOfTheStormScreamer/7-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00090_SagaOfTheStormScreamer/7-06.htm",
   "quest": 90,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Countless thoughts beyond comprehension sear painfully into your brain. A vision appears of a woman in blue. The location of the next Stone of Commune suddenly becomes clear... Magister Kamilen of Goddard Castle Town has it.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00092_SagaOfTheElementalMaster/7-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00092_SagaOfTheElementalMaster/7-02.htm",
   "quest": 92,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: When putting your hands on the tablet, your entire body is knocked back by something powerful but invisible. Then, it begins to appear.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00092_SagaOfTheElementalMaster/7-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00092_SagaOfTheElementalMaster/7-03.htm",
   "quest": 92,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The Tablet of Vision cannot be accessed without the Stone of Commune. Defeat Shakiel and take the stone from him.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00092_SagaOfTheElementalMaster/7-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00092_SagaOfTheElementalMaster/7-04.htm",
   "quest": 92,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Someone else is currently communing with the Tablet of Vision. Come back later.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00092_SagaOfTheElementalMaster/7-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00092_SagaOfTheElementalMaster/7-06.htm",
   "quest": 92,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The Tablet of Vision begins to illuminate the room and engulfs you in its wake. Thunderous chanting clogs your mind and yet gives you understand of something.... something that cannot be understood! You hear a familiar woman's voice whispering again...Arden Castle Town...there is …",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00097_SagaOfTheShillienTemplar/7-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00097_SagaOfTheShillienTemplar/7-02.htm",
   "quest": 97,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: A huge golem appears! He's the one that was featured in the guild bulletin I got from Galadrid! I must be very careful!",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00097_SagaOfTheShillienTemplar/7-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00097_SagaOfTheShillienTemplar/7-03.htm",
   "quest": 97,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: You must get the Stone of Commune from that golem!",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00097_SagaOfTheShillienTemplar/7-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00097_SagaOfTheShillienTemplar/7-04.htm",
   "quest": 97,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: There's fight going on over there. Let's wait here for a moment until the fighting finishes.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00097_SagaOfTheShillienTemplar/7-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00097_SagaOfTheShillienTemplar/7-06.htm",
   "quest": 97,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Countless thoughts beyond comprehension sear painfully into your brain. The secrets of the tablet start to be revealed. As the pain subsides, a vision appears... It's Samael! And then the vision fades... Find Samael ! He has the Stone of Commune!",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
